200 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 112 0 R
/T (A railwaylevel-crossing controller is an inherentlystate-driven safety-critical embedded system. The crossing physical actuators \(barrier gates, warning lights, acoustic bells\) cannot operate in response to raw sensor triggers without context; doing so would induce race conditions, hazardous opening while a train occupies the crossing, or mechanical damage from contradictory motor drive commands. Therefore, a formal, deterministic state-based architecture is essential. Nine distinct operational states are established to completely partition system behavior across all lifecycle phases. )
/E (A railwaylevel-crossing controller is an inherentlystate-driven safety-critical embedded system. The crossing physical actuators \(barrier gates, warning lights, acoustic bells\) cannot operate in response to raw sensor triggers without context; doing so would induce race conditions, hazardous opening while a train occupies the crossing, or mechanical damage from contradictory motor drive commands. Therefore, a formal, deterministic state-based architecture is essential. Nine distinct operational states are established to completely partition system behavior across all lifecycle phases. )
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
