/E (Implementation of Stack Resource Policy \(SRP\): All shared mutexes are bound under SRP. Under SRP, a task is blocked only at the moment it attempts to preempt, for at most the duration of a single longest critical section of any lower-priority task. All critical section execution budgets are strictly clamped to B_max <= 0.50 ms. )
