669 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 122 0 R
/E (ENGINEERING DECISION 4: A strict Priority-Based Selective Overwrite Policy is enforced. Underhigh- frequency burst conditions, the log classifier evaluates event severity before writing. Informationaland telemetry events \(Ring 1\) utilize circular overwrite semantics \(FIFO drop\). However, Critical SafetyEvents \(Ring 0\) are strictly immutable; they are granted non-preemptible write locks. In the theoreticaleventof Ring 0 reaching capacity, low-priority tasks are throttled by the RTOS scheduler to allow thededicated logging worker to flush records across the SPI-FRAM bus. Under no operational circumstanceisacritical safety or fault event overwritten or dropped. )
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
