/T (1. Override OPEN Command Invalidation: If the system is in State S2 \(Warning Active\), S3 \(Barrier Closing\), S4 \(Barrier Closed\), or S5 \(Train Passing\), ANY manual command requesting 'BARRIER OPEN' is STRICTLY INHIBITED and rejected by the hardware-interlocked state machine. Allowing a human operator to lift the gates while an approaching train is within the safety threshold is a catastrophic hazard. )
/E (1. Override OPEN Command Invalidation: If the system is in State S2 \(Warning Active\), S3 \(Barrier Closing\), S4 \(Barrier Closed\), or S5 \(Train Passing\), ANY manual command requesting 'BARRIER OPEN' is STRICTLY INHIBITED and rejected by the hardware-interlocked state machine. Allowing a human operator to lift the gates while an approaching train is within the safety threshold is a catastrophic hazard. )
