/T (Scenario:During active service, the Doppler radar / optical grid road-vehicle obstacle sensor suffers a completehardware failure or power disconnection, while railway track sensors and barrier actuators continueoperating normally. A naive system might either stall the crossing indefinitely \(causing gridlock\) or operateblindly \(risking trapping vehicles\). Our architecture implements a mathematically defensible, multi-faceted Degraded-Mode Policy. )
