800 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 127 0 R
/T (This project has established arigorous, industry-grade embedded systems engineering design for an automated railway level-crossingcontroller. Through systematic evaluation across all seven design stages, the assignment requirements forCourse Outcome 4 \(CO4\) have been exhaustively satisfied. The resulting controller guarantees deterministic event response, bounded memory utilization, robust resource synchronization, and uncompromising safety under both nominal and catastrophic hardware failure scenarios. )
/E (This project has established arigorous, industry-grade embedded systems engineering design for an automated railway level-crossingcontroller. Through systematic evaluation across all seven design stages, the assignment requirements forCourse Outcome 4 \(CO4\) have been exhaustively satisfied. The resulting controller guarantees deterministic event response, bounded memory utilization, robust resource synchronization, and uncompromising safety under both nominal and catastrophic hardware failure scenarios. )
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
