>>
endobj
960 0 obj
<<
/Title (This project has established arigorous, industry-grade embedded systems engineering design for an automated railway level-crossingcontroller. Through systematic evaluation across all seven design stages, the assignment requirements forCourse Outcome 4 \(CO4\) have been exhaustively satisfied. The resulting controller guarantees deterministic event response, bounded memory utilization, robust resource synchronization, and uncompromising safety under both nominal and catastrophic hardware failure scenarios.)
/Dest [29 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 814 0 R
>>
endobj
