/Title (A railwaylevel-crossing controller is an inherentlystate-driven safety-critical embedded system. The crossing physical actuators \(barrier gates, warning lights, acoustic bells\) cannot operate in response to raw sensor triggers without context; doing so would induce race conditions, hazardous opening while a train occupies the crossing, or mechanical damage from contradictory motor drive commands. Therefore, a formal, deterministic state-based architecture is essential. Nine distinct operational states are established to completely partition system behavior across all lifecycle phases.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1364 0 R
/Next 1382 0 R
>>
endobj
